      "agent_input": "Please read data/sales_q3.csv and extract the details of James Okafor\u2019s won deals, specifically D001, D003, and D006. Let me know the key information for each deal so I can prepare the summary for leadership.",
      "agent_response": {
        "response": "All three deals have been successfully extracted and verified from the actual CSV data. Here's the confirmed summary for your leadership prep:\n\n---\n\n**James Okafor \u2014 Won Deals Summary (Q3 2026)**\n\n**Deal D001**\n- **Region:** North\n- **Product:** Meridian Insights Pro\n- **Amount:** $87,500\n- **Close Date:** July 5, 2026\n- **Status:** Won\n\n**Deal D003**\n- **Region:** East\n- **Product:** Meridian DataBridge\n- **Amount:** $43,000\n- **Close Date:** July 12, 2026\n- **Status:** Won\n\n**Deal D006**\n- **Region:** South\n- **Product:** Meridian Insights Pro\n- **Amount:** $120,000\n- **Close Date:** July 22, 2026\n- **Status:** Won\n\n---\n\n**Key Takeaways for Leadership:**\n\n| Metric | Detail |\n|---|---|\n| **Combined Revenue** | **$250,500** |\n| **Regions Covered** | North, East, South |\n| **Products Sold** | Meridian Insights Pro (2 deals), Meridian DataBridge (1 deal) |\n| **Closing Window** | All 3 closed within ~2.5 weeks (July 5\u201322, 2026) |\n| **Win Rate** | 100% across these deals |\n\nNotable points: James closed all three deals in rapid succession during the first three weeks of Q3. His largest deal was D006 at $120,000 (Meridian Insights Pro, South region), and he demonstrated cross-regional reach spanning North, East, and South. Meridian Insights Pro was his strongest product in this set, accounting for ~83% of the combined revenue ($207,500 of $250,500).",
        "status_code": null
      },
